{
    "title": "Crema: Social Meal Video Chat",
    "description": "MAKE NEW FRIENDS AROUND THE WORLD OVER A MEAL\r\n\r\nCrema is a platform that enables a social meal experience in an authentic way. \r\nInstead of matching & chatting like in most friendship & dating apps, you\u2019ll find virtual dining buddies where you can connect over a tasty meal. \r\nIf you are looking for a new exciting way to meet new friends or maybe find singles for online dating, Crema is your go-to app.\r\nDownload now for free to talk with friends from around the world and have your first virtual date.\r\n\r\nTHE SOCIAL MEAL EXPERIENCE WITH INTERNATIONAL SINGLES\r\nOur app lets you invite your locals, or foreigners to share a meal with you virtually without leaving your home! \r\nWith Crema, you can connect in an entirely new way. Just send a virtual meal invitation to the people you like through the app, and we\u2019ll handle the rest. After you fill in the details, we\u2019ll deliver a tasty meal to you and your virtual dining buddy, letting you enjoy the experience together from the comfort of your own homes.\r\n\r\nMORE THAN JUST VIRTUAL DATES WITH GLOBAL FRIENDS\r\nCrema is more than just sharing food \u2013 it\u2019s about building genuine connections with the people you like and who have the same interests. Whether you\u2019re looking for a fun and simple way to socialize, or to meet new friends that are part of our international community, Crema allows you to connect with them on a personal level.\r\n\r\nCHAT WITH PEOPLE WITH VIDEO CALLS & AI TRANSLATION\r\nMeet Latinos from Latin America, the USA, Europeans, Asians, or anything in between. Crema is an international community of global friends looking for the same thing: to make new friends in a fun way. Crema supports video chatting with built-in AI translation to strengthen your connection. \r\n\r\nCREMA \u2013 MAKE NEW FRIENDS APP FEATURES:\r\n- Present yourself with a video\r\n- Showcase your interests and find like-minded friends\r\n- Meet new people or discover your next love interest\r\n- Have a meal together over an online video\r\n- Favorite videos and users\r\n- Live translations of the video calls\r\n\r\nSo what are you waiting for? Download Crema today and start connecting with new people in a new way. Who knows \u2013 you might just make a new friend over lunch!\r\n\r\nTry Crema \u2013 Social Meal Experience for free",
    "descriptionHTML": "MAKE NEW FRIENDS AROUND THE WORLD OVER A MEAL<br><br>Crema is a platform that enables a social meal experience in an authentic way. <br>Instead of matching &amp; chatting like in most friendship &amp; dating apps, you\u2019ll find virtual dining buddies where you can connect over a tasty meal. <br>If you are looking for a new exciting way to meet new friends or maybe find singles for online dating, Crema is your go-to app.<br>Download now for free to talk with friends from around the world and have your first virtual date.<br><br>THE SOCIAL MEAL EXPERIENCE WITH INTERNATIONAL SINGLES<br>Our app lets you invite your locals, or foreigners to share a meal with you virtually without leaving your home! <br>With Crema, you can connect in an entirely new way. Just send a virtual meal invitation to the people you like through the app, and we\u2019ll handle the rest. After you fill in the details, we\u2019ll deliver a tasty meal to you and your virtual dining buddy, letting you enjoy the experience together from the comfort of your own homes.<br><br>MORE THAN JUST VIRTUAL DATES WITH GLOBAL FRIENDS<br>Crema is more than just sharing food \u2013 it\u2019s about building genuine connections with the people you like and who have the same interests. Whether you\u2019re looking for a fun and simple way to socialize, or to meet new friends that are part of our international community, Crema allows you to connect with them on a personal level.<br><br>CHAT WITH PEOPLE WITH VIDEO CALLS &amp; AI TRANSLATION<br>Meet Latinos from Latin America, the USA, Europeans, Asians, or anything in between. Crema is an international community of global friends looking for the same thing: to make new friends in a fun way. Crema supports video chatting with built-in AI translation to strengthen your connection. <br><br>CREMA \u2013 MAKE NEW FRIENDS APP FEATURES:<br>- Present yourself with a video<br>- Showcase your interests and find like-minded friends<br>- Meet new people or d